2. Train data

The underlying train data comes from the Deutsche Bahn Timetables API, published by Deutsche Bahn
under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license (CC BY 4.0,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), collected via the archive
https://huggingface.co/datasets/piebro/deutsche-bahn-data. Nothing in this file restricts anyone's
rights to Deutsche Bahn's original data under CC BY 4.0.

The processed data in this repository (data/ and docs/data/), including daily points, tables,
rankings and forecasts, is derived from that data and is covered by section 1.

Attribution: Data: Deutsche Bahn AG, CC BY 4.0.

